`AGENTS.md` = source of truth for project-wide agent instructions.

Documentation map:

- `docs/README.md` - documentation index and update rules.
- `docs/specs/assignment-1-rest-web-demo.md` - REST/web/Android demo spec.
- `docs/specs/assignment-2-response-control.md` - response-control assignment spec.
- `docs/specs/assignment-3-reasoning-modes.md` - reasoning-mode assignment spec.
- `docs/specs/submission-snapshot-policy.md` - daily snapshot submission policy.
- `docs/agent-notes/llm-demo-assignment-2.md` - implementation decisions, provider notes, debugging workflow, and guardrails.
- `docs/agent-notes/llm-demo-assignment-3.md` - Day 3 implementation notes.

Daily assignments are submitted as repository snapshots. Current-day requirements may replace or break previous-day UI/behavior. Do not preserve old flows by default; follow `docs/specs/submission-snapshot-policy.md`.

Cursor rule always attached, intentionally short. Do not duplicate long specs/debug notes here; update canonical docs.

Key guardrails:

- Keep LLM calls explicit REST via `httpx.post`.
- Keep `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` backend-only.
- Prefer no-network payload checks before real OpenRouter calls.
